        <initializer>= false</initializer>
        <briefdescription>
        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
<para>When true, refreshUSBStatus() rejects the USB unless the filesystem is mounted read-only. A read-only mount prevents any process running on the host from writing to the stick while it is in use. </para>
