        <name>expected_volume_hash</name>
        <qualifiedname>themis::security::USBAdminConfig::expected_volume_hash</qualifiedname>
        <briefdescription>
        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
<para>If non-empty, refreshUSBStatus() rejects the USB unless the SHA-256 hash of the license file matches this value (lowercase hex, 64 chars). Provision this value from a secure, server-side configuration store. Any FAT-level modification of the license file will be detected. </para>
        </detaileddescription>
